## 10. Conclusion

The Employee Management System provides a centralized platform for managing employee information.

It helps simplify employee record management, department transfers, employee searches, and access control through a web-based application.

The project demonstrates the use of Java, Spring Boot, MySQL, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript in developing an employee management application.

